<h1 class="guide-title">Seascape Booking Research: Scope and Evidence</h1>
<div class="guide-content">
<p>For a Seascape stay, compare the home, your dates and the complete checkout total. Our homes are in Bradenton and Sarasota; a regional average cannot tell you what your trip will cost.</p>
<section class="methodology" aria-label="Research evidence status">
<strong>Source note — October 5, 2026:</strong> The earlier report described Seascape reservations from June 2022 through March 2026. Its numeric results are withheld because an archived reservation export, inclusion rules and reviewed calculations are not available with this report. No booking count, rate, revenue, channel share or guest average is presented as a verified finding.
</section>
<h2>What Seascape can confirm</h2>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table class="data-table">
<caption>Seascape information and where to check it</caption>
<thead><tr><th>Question</th><th>Seascape information</th><th>Where to check</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Where are the homes?</td><td>Bradenton and Sarasota, Florida.</td><td><a href="/properties/">Current Seascape listings</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>What will my stay cost?</td><td>Pricing depends on the home, dates, guests and selected extras.</td><td>The complete checkout total for your trip.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Does a dock or pool predict revenue?</td><td>A property feature alone does not establish a revenue result.</td><td>Property-specific reservations, expenses and comparable operating periods.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Limits of the earlier report</h2>
<p>Seascape reservations describe Seascape homes. They cannot establish an Anna Maria Island, Longboat Key, Siesta Key or Florida Gulf Coast market average. Comparing different homes and operating periods cannot isolate a waterfront premium. A past seasonal rate difference does not guarantee a discount for your dates.</p>
<h2>Booking decisions</h2>
<p>Compare the same home, dates and guest count across channels. Include rent, cleaning, taxes, fees and optional extras, then compare cancellation and payment terms. There is no fixed direct-booking savings amount.</p>
<p><a href="/guides/booking-direct-vacation-rentals/">Compare direct booking with a platform quote</a>, or browse <a href="/stays/bradenton-vacation-rentals-near-beaches/">Bradenton homes near AMI</a>. Local trip planning is in the <a href="/guides/">guides</a>.</p>
<section class="methodology" aria-label="Research questions"><strong>Research questions</strong><p>For questions about the earlier study or its evidence, contact <a href="mailto:info@seascape-vacations.com">info@seascape-vacations.com</a>.</p></section>
</div>
